        "Muthoot FinCorp wins Team India title rights in a 150 crore BCCI deal.",
        "India-US trade deal is 90%-plus done according to an American official."
      ]
    }
  },
  "geopolitics": {
    "kicker": "India x US | Trade Deal",
    "headline": "India-US Trade Pact Over 90% Complete",
    "paragraphs": [
      "The India-US trade pact is over 90% complete and poised to unleash another level of bilateral ties, according to an American official. Union Commerce Minister Piyush Goyal stated that the deal is almost done and dusted. Meanwhile, Foreign Secretary Vikram Misri flagged tariff moves during his discussions with the US undersecretary.",
      "While both nations are closing in on an agreement, unresolved tariff issues remain a vital topic of negotiations. Resolving these final points will determine how smoothly cross-border commerce moves forward. Businesses in both countries are watching closely as finalized terms could significantly boost trade and investment flows."
    ],
